{"product_id":"olivia-joules-and-the-overactive-imagination","title":"Olivia Joules and the Overactive Imagination","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the white heat of Miami to the implants of LA, the glittering waters of the Caribbean to the deserts of Arabia, Olivia Joules pits herself against the forces of terror armed only with a hatpin, razor sharp wits and a very special underwired bra. Is it possible that the alluring and powerful Pierre Ferramo, with his impeccable taste and unimaginable wealth, is actually a major terrorist, bent on the western world's destruction? Or is it all just a product of Olivia Joules's overactive imagination? Join Olivia in her heart-stopping and hilarious quest to save the world in this witty, contemporary and utterly unputdownable thriller.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Helen Fielding\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780330432733\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 343\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 196\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595422339225,"sku":"10RA9780330432733","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/olivia-joules-and-the-overactive-imagination-131011.jpg?v=1694791178","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/olivia-joules-and-the-overactive-imagination","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}